<ResponsiveContainer AlignItems="Enums.AlignItems.Center" Type="ContainerType.Flex" JustifyContent="Enums.JustifyContent.Center" >

    <ResponsiveGridContainer Columns="2" Width="80">

        @foreach (var discordServer in _discordServers)
        {
            <DiscordCard Title="@discordServer.Title" DiscordInviteLink="@discordServer.DiscordInviteLink" />
        }

    </ResponsiveGridContainer>

</ResponsiveContainer>
